  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B the right.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “¿Cómo está usted?” Use usted for one person you don't know well, ustedes for several.",
    "B hears the question and builds the answer. The verb ending shows the person, so Spanish drops the pronoun. A tile in brackets, like (yo), says who: do not write it. A pronoun without brackets, like yo or usted, is written.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Finally: swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
